It's an interesting idea, but one that would involve rather a lot of
extra work on my part - both in terms of putting the cluster together,
and in adapting my code.  On the other hand, there's nothing stopping
me from buying more than one box, and spreading the load among them at
a much higher level (not using Beowulf/PVM, but simply running
independent replicates on each CPU). =


