1. NT only first offering, SRM not needed. (this was a decision not to delay
first customer ships)
2. Why, SRM and Unix/VMS  had not finished qual testing when the box in NT
config, was ready to ship.

subsequent firmware updates, gave all version of PWS's similar
SRM/Alphabios capabilities.

To change from srm to alphabios the command at the srm prompt is "set
os_type nt" without the quotes. just typing "arc" will invoke alphabios for
that instance, if you power cycle it will revert back to srm.


