Before using the auto_action command below, you should make sure that your 
machine boots properly using
>>> b

If that doesn't work, you have to change your boot settings.
>>> sho bootdef_dev
>>> sho boot_file
>>> sho boot_osflags

When you're all set, 
>>> sho auto_action
>>> set auto_action boot
And then power cycle your machine, or perhaps just type >>> init


