through the faq sites listed above.

Boot from the jumpstart CD as described in the faqs, and tell it to prepare 
your hard drive for linux.  Be aware that you will erase your hard drive by 
doing this.

Decide what distribution of Linux you want to use, and obtain the CDs.  If 
you finish all of this, you've made good progress.  Ask any other relevant 
questions as needed.


